+        # validation-50603 enabling fix: the HF rule is that the number of
+        # position axes equals len(mrope_section); transformers normalizes
+        # 4-axis xdrope models (e.g. HunYuanVL) into a 4-section mrope, so
+        # size the buffer from the config instead of the hardcoded 3 or the
+        # 4th channel is silently dropped by init_prefill_positions' row loop.
         return RopeState(
-            num_dims=3,
